      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Date Specific Overrides (DSO)"
        ],
        "summary": "Add/Update a listing's date specific override",
        "description": "Use this API to update a date specific override. Following conditions are to be **followed strictly** before you send the data to update\n\n#### Rules:\n1. When adding/updating **`price`** object make sure the `price_type` is one of the two (`fixed` or `percent`). If there is anything other than these two options then the update for price will be ignored.\n\t* When sending `price_type` as `fixed` make sure currency is exactly what you have in your PMS. If currency is different between date specific override and  listing, your update will result in erroneous data.\n\t* When sending `price_type` as `percent`, the percentage change will be applied on the recommended base price.\n\n2. When updating **`min_stay`** send an integer greater than 0.\n3. When updating **`min_price`** object make sure the `min_price_type` is `fixed` or else update will result in erroneous data.\n\t* When sending `min_price_type` as `fixed` make sure currency is exactly what you have in your PMS. \n\n 4. If the flag `update_children`, which is a boolean flag, sent as true, the DSO will also be updated for all the child listings. If you send `update_children` as false, then DSO will only be updated for the parent listing and not for the child listings. \n\n 5. If `price_type` is fixed, then `price` represents the fixed price. If `price_type` is percent, then `price` is the percentage change on the recommended price and should have a value ranging from -75 to 500. \n\n 6. If `min_price_type` is fixed, then `min_price` is the fixed price. If `min_price_type` is percent_base or percent_min, then `min_price` represents a percentage change on the base price or the minimum price, respectively, and should have a value ranging from -75 to 500. \n\n 7. If `max_price_type` is fixed, then `max_price` is the fixed maximum price. If `max_price_type` is percent_base or percent_max, then `max_price` represents a percentage change on the listing base price or the maximum price, respectively, and should have a value ranging from -75 to 500.   \n\n#### Response:\nResponse will contain data for each date that was updated, if something was erroneous then the response will not have that object. The extra key `child_listings_update_info` is added to the response when `update_children` is true. If you pass `update_children` as true for a listing which does not have any child listing, an empty object will be sent back  in `child_listings_update_info`.",
        "operationId": "listingDateLevelOverrides1",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "X-API-Key",
            "in": "header",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "example": "{{API_KEY}}"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "listing_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "example": ""
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "overrides": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "date": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "example": "2023-07-20"
                        },
                        "price": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "example": "150",
                          "description": "If price_type is fixed, then price represents the fixed price. If price_type is percent, then price is the percentage change on the recommended price and should have a value ranging from -75 to 500."
                        },
                        "price_type": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "Possible values are 'fixed' OR 'percent'. If sent as percent, it will be applied on recommended price",
                          "example": "fixed",
                          "enum": [
                            "percent",
                            "fixed"
                          ]
                        },
                        "currency": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "example": "EUR"
                        },
                        "min_stay": {
                          "type": "number",
                          "example": 4
                        },
                        "min_price": {
                          "type": "number",
                          "example": 100,
                          "description": "If min_price_type is fixed, then min_price is the fixed price. If min_price_type is percent_base or percent_min, then min_price represents a percentage change on the base price or the minimum price, respectively, and should have a value ranging from -75 to 500."
                        },
                        "min_price_type": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "example": "fixed",
                          "enum": [
                            "fixed",
                            "percent_base",
                            "percent_min"
                          ]
                        },
                        "max_price": {
                          "type": "number",
                          "example": "200",
                          "description": "If max_price_type is fixed, then max_price is the fixed maximum price.If max_price_type is percent_base or percent_max, then max_price represents a percentage change on the listing base price or the maximum price, respectively, and should have a value ranging from -75 to 500."
                        },
                        "max_price_type": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "example": "fixed",
                          "enum": [
                            "fixed",
                            "percent_base",
                            "percent_max"
                          ]
                        },
                        "base_price": {
                          "type": "number",
                          "example": 100
                        },
                        "check_in_check_out_enabled": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "example": "1"
                        },
                        "check_in": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "example": "0100011"
                        },
                        "check_out": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "example": "1000010"
                        },
                        "reason": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "example": "Test Reason"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "example": [
                      {
                        "date": "2023-07-16",
                        "price": "122",
                        "price_type": "fixed",
                        "currency": "EUR",
                        "min_stay": 8,
                        "min_price": 99,
                        "min_price_type": "fixed",
                        "max_price": 149,
                        "max_price_type": "fixed",
                        "base_price": 100,
                        "check_in_check_out_enabled": "1",
                        "check_in": "0000010",
                        "check_out": "0000001",
                        "reason": "DSO update"
                      },
                      {
                        "date": "2023-07-18",
                        "price": "122",
                        "price_type": "percent",
                        "min_stay": 8,
                        "check_in_check_out_enabled": "0",
                        "reason": "DSO update"
                      },
                      {
                        "date": "2023-07-20",
                        "price": 0,
                        "min_stay": 4,
                        "check_in_check_out_enabled": "1",
                        "check_in": "0010001",
                        "check_out": "0000101",
                        "reason": "DSO update"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "pms": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "apaleo"
                  },
                  "update_children": {
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "example": true,
                    "description": "Sending this flag as true will also update DSO for child listings"
                  }
                }
              },
              "example": {
                "pms": "apaleo",
                "update_children": true,
                "overrides": [
                  {
                    "date": "2023-07-16",
                    "price": "122",
                    "price_type": "fixed",
                    "currency": "EUR",
                    "min_stay": 8,
                    "min_price": 99,
                    "min_price_type": "fixed",
                    "max_price": 149,
                    "max_price_type": "fixed",
                    "base_price": 100,
                    "check_in_check_out_enabled": "1",
                    "check_in": "0000010",
                    "check_out": "0000001",
                    "reason": "DSO update"
                  },
                  {
                    "date": "2023-07-18",
                    "price": "122",
                    "price_type": "percent",
                    "min_stay": 8,
                    "check_in_check_out_enabled": "0",
                    "reason": "DSO update"
                  },
                  {
                    "date": "2023-07-20",
                    "price": 0,
                    "min_stay": 4,
                    "check_in_check_out_enabled": "1",
                    "check_in": "0010001",
                    "check_out": "0000101",
                    "reason": "DSO update"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        },
